    /// The open table's CAPTURED entries (CDDL `* k2 => v2`, the trailing catch-all row): every map entry the typed row did not claim. Defaults empty. `@duplicates preserve` makes this a `PairMap` (duplicate keys kept, in wire order); otherwise the loose table container.
